Hi Ahmed,

Thank you for sending the purchasing draft language. We cannot proceed with S=
ection 11.2 as written because it leaves Halstead's aggregate liability witho=
ut a monetary limit.

The attached redline proposes a cap equal to the annual recurring fees specif=
ied in the applicable order form, excluding taxes and one-time fees. It is a =
negotiation proposal for Section 11.2 only. Please pass it to your purchasing=
 and legal teams and let us know their proposed revisions or their views on t=
his wording.

I look forward to hearing from you.

Thank you,
Michelle Whitaker
Halstead Branch Communications Inc

